    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm stuck in a loop of making things worse. every time i try to get better, it just costs more money or more energy that theydont have. it feels like my existence is just a series of subtractions from their lives instead of additions. if i just stopped being a drain, wouldn't that be the most selfless thing i could actually do for them? like, wouldn't that be the only way to actually help?",
